        </p>
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 space-y-1"
        >
          <div>
            Internal Fluid Capacity = π × (Internal Diameter / 2)² × Length
          </div>
          <div>
            If Wall Thickness (t) is given: Internal Diameter = Outer Diameter −
